OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with  
OL,6,Frain over Orkney slowly easing in the  
OL,7,Fevening, a few outbreaks of rain for   
OL,8,FShetland. Overnight a light outbreaks  
OL,9,Fof rain lingering, but mostly dry.     
OL,10,FStrong southeasterly winds.            
OL,12,CThursday:FMostly cloudy day but with a 
OL,13,Ffew brighter intervals. The odd light  
OL,14,Foutbreak of rain possible but a        
OL,15,Flargely dry day. Strong southeasterly  
OL,16,Fwinds with gales or severe gales       
OL,17,Fdeveloping.                            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
