OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain and 
OL,6,Fstrong winds, reaching severe gales at 
OL,7,Ftimes, spreading eastwards. Cloudy     
OL,8,Fwith rain and strong winds at times on 
OL,9,FSaturday. Bright spells and showers on 
OL,10,FSunday.                                
